1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(Noble Consort Hui
loses control of the palace.)

4
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,360
(Xiao'an Palace)
Your Highness.

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:23,120
I've set up a prayer altar
in the imperial garden.

6
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,640
The priest will soon perform
a rite and light the sky lanterns.

7
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,120
Our prayers for Your Highness

8
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,280
will surely reach the heavens

9
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,680
and straight to the Buddha.

10
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,480
May Your Highness enjoy good health

11
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,640
and a long, blessed life.

12
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,840
(Xiao'an Palace)
How thoughtful, Noble Consort Hui.

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,120
Mother.

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,240
Noble Consort Hui is your niece.

15
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,160
Of course she should

16
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,160
be devoted to you.

17
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,360
(Xiao'an Palace)
Your Majesty, Your Highness.

18
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,640
Lyu'e of Zhongning Palace
has an urgent matter to report.

19
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:08,240
You...

20
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,440
How dare you!

21
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,520
What are you doing?

22
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:14,880
Are you burning joss paper
in the palace?

23
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:15,760
I wouldn't dare.

24
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,800
I wouldn't dare!

25
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,600
Your Majesty, Your Highness.

26
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:20,840
Look.

27
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,480
Cairen Rong secretly prepared
joss paper and candles

28
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,280
for secret mourning.

29
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:25,600
She defied Your Highness's decree.

30
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,720
Such conduct

31
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,600
endangers your health.

32
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,280
I had to report it.

33
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,120
Cairen Rong.

34
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,720
How dare you!

35
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,400
I should never have let you out.

36
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,600
I deserve death for this.

37
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,080
I failed to discipline her.

38
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:38,880
Guards.

39
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,720
Drag this treacherous wretch

40
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,680
away at once!

41
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:43,320
Yes.

42
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,360
No!

43
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,600
Cairen Rong.

44
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,840
What's that wound on your arm?

45
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,800
I heard the Buddhist sutras say,

46
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,600
Medicine King Bodhisattva​​
burned his arm.

47
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,240
And the Buddha gave his flesh
to feed an eagle.

48
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,720
Filial sons cut their own bone
to heal a parent.

49
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,320
I'm low in rank,

50
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,600
with no talents.

51
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:06,240
So I could only

52
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,000
use my own blood

53
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,160
to copy the sacred scriptures.

54
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:10,720
Tonight, here,

55
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:12,040
I offer gold leaf

56
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,720
in prayer for Your Highness.

57
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,920
May the realm be at peace,

58
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:19,120
and Your Majesty and
Your Highness enjoy good health.

59
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,120
Consort Qi, rise.

60
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,320
Yes.

61
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,400
Your Highness.

62
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:44,920
Your Highness.

63
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,000
There's something else.

64
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,720
(The southwest threatens the throne.
Beware the cold palace's corruption.)

65
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,080
Royal authority is threatened
from the southwest.

66
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,480
Lewd acts in the cold palace.

67
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,280
The fate of the realm is at stake.

68
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,680
Beware the first sign.

69
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,960
Lewd acts in the cold palace.

70
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,960
(If you want to make a scene,)

71
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,600
(let's make it a bigger one.)

72
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,960
(Noble Consort Hui.)

73
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:02,600
(Let's see how you trip yourself up.)

74
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,880
The words appeared on the doll.

75
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,320
Could it be...

76
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,480
A sign from the heavens?

77
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,040
Concubine Rou.

78
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,720
What nonsense are you saying?

79
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,880
His Majesty and Her Highness
can hear you.

80
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,800
This is clearly superstition.

81
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:19,960
Concubine Jing.

82
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,520
Strange things fill the palace.

83
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:22,400
The Empress Dowager is unwell.

84
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,960
His Majesty and Noble Consort
are deeply worried.

85
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:27,480
They asked the ​​Imperial Observatory
to study the heavens,

86
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,760
and invited Master Yongren
into the palace to drive out evil.

87
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,440
Their devotion

88
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,720
is witnessed by heaven.

89
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,520
So, dear Concubine Jing,

90
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,400
would you call it superstition?

91
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,600
I misspoke.

92
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:41,680
I misspoke.

93
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,800
I beg Your Highness and

94
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,960
Your Majesty to forgive me.

95
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,360
Rise.

96
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:49,640
Could it be that

97
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,400
something truly strange

98
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,080
happened in the cold palace?

99
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,600
The cold palace...

100
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:58,760
I was recently released from there.

101
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,240
I know a little

102
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,760
about what goes on there.

103
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,120
A few days ago,

104
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,320
someone used burning mugwort as a cover

105
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,200
did shameless things.

106
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,880
Is this truly the case?

107
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:13,560
Yes.

108
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:16,360
I feared it would upset you,

109
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:19,040
so I ordered no one to inform you.

110
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,080
Summon Li Chengyan.

111
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,080
Yes.

112
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,480
Your Majesty. Your Highness.

113
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,880
Your Majesty, please look.

114
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,280
I was passing by the cold palace
that day

115
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,120
when I noticed something odd
about the mugwort smoke.

116
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,760
I went in with the guards
to investigate.

117
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,520
We found that someone had mixed

118
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,800
a sleeping powder into the mugwort.

119
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,880
Everyone was asleep.

120
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,960
Zhaoyi Shen took the chance
to meet a man in secret.

121
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:56,400
But I checked the Imperial Hospital's
records from the past six months,

122
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,280
only Noble Consort Hui's Chengxi Palace

123
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,520
requested herbs used to
make that knockout powder.

124
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,400
How dare you!

125
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:03,240
Are you framing me?

126
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,120
Your Majesty.

127
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,120
I haven't slept well
for the past six months.

128
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,880
So the physician prepared these herbs

129
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,960
and told me to burn a little before bed

130
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,040
to help me sleep.

131
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,640
The remaining powder

132
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,040
was kept in my private cabinet.

133
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,960
I've never shared it.

134
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,560
Someone must be framing me!

135
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,560
Your Majesty.

136
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,000
I have

137
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,800
another piece of evidence.

138
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,800
Bring it here.

139
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,520
Yes.

140
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,320
That day, when Zhaoyi Shen was
caught with a man in the cold palace,

141
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:40,280
I found this dudou at the scene.

142
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,960
Someone must have dropped it
in their haste to flee.

143
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,320
It's stitched with gold thread.

144
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:49,840
Zhaoyi Shen has no right
to wear something like this.

145
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,880
Such a precious item

146
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,400
could only be worn

147
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,040
by someone of

148
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,440
Noble Consort rank.

149
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,720
That's no proof.

150
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,400
Your Majesty.

151
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,760
All the consorts can have
clothes made to order.

152
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,960
And this is a private garment.

153
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,040
Who's to say she didn't wear it
beyond her rank?

154
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,120
Cairen Rong, stop slandering!

155
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,320
Your Majesty, please judge fairly.

156
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,200
I would never accuse anyone
without cause.

157
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,960
The Imperial Household Embroidery
Workshop and the Weaving Bureau

158
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,200
keep records of every consort's orders.

159
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:19,600
Which embroiderer made it,

160
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:22,240
and which consort took it.

161
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,320
It's all on record.

162
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,520
One check will settle it.

163
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:30,720
Noble Consort Hui is my own niece.

164
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,320
I've watched her grow up.

165
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:36,280
She'd never do such filthy things.

166
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:37,880
Your Majesty.

167
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,240
This concerns
Noble Consort Hui's reputation,

168
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:44,000
as well as the dignity of
the imperial family and myself.

169
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,360
It must be fully investigated

170
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,880
to clear Noble Consort Hui's name.

171
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,480
Your Highness...

172
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,560
Don't worry.

173
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,280
I will never allow

174
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,840
anyone in the palace
to slander you without cause.

175
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,920
I'll stand by you today.

176
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,360
Let them investigate.

177
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,880
I want to see

178
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,240
who dares smear my niece's name!

179
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,440
Guards.

180
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,720
Investigate this at once!

181
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:07,440
Yes.

182
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,800
Your Majesty! Your Highness!

183
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,200
I am guilty.

184
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:12,000
It was all my doing.

185
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:14,920
I had Lyu'e place the doll
in the basket.

186
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,600
I meant to frame Cairen Rong.

187
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,320
And the bloodstained bats,

188
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,720
the bloody handprints on the walls.

189
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,360
I had them all arranged.

190
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,840
There were no evil things,

191
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:25,400
nor any warning from heaven.

192
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,920
It was all my fault.

193
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,280
I beg Your Majesty to punish me!

194
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,680
What did you say?

195
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:30,920
Noble Consort Hui!

196
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:31,960
You...

197
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,440
Your Highness.

198
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,760
I lost my senses.

199
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,280
I was jealous of Cairen Rong,

200
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:38,520
who left the cold palace
and immediately won favor.

201
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,000
Then Lyu'e came to me
with her secret offerings,

202
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,440
and I lost my head.

203
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,840
I was wrong...

204
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,320
Please show mercy, Your Highness.

205
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:49,600
You knew I was

206
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,840
sick with worry over Princess Duanjing,

207
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:54,120
and yet you

208
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,880
would commit such treason
over a petty rivalry

209
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,880
with a mere Cairen?

210
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,960
Do you have any respect for me?

211
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,880
Or for your elder sister, Duanjing?

212
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:06,560
You...

213
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:10,760
You have truly disappointed me!

214
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,680
Noble Consort Hui.

215
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,240
I trusted you.

216
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,040
I put you in charge of the harem.

217
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,360
I gave you supreme honor.

218
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,160
And this is how you repay me?

219
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,160
Your Majesty...

220
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,800
I was being foolish.

221
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,280
Have mercy, Your Majesty.

222
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,480
Being foolish?

223
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,680
You plotted to frighten
the Empress Dowager,

224
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,640
practiced forbidden arts in the palace,

225
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,240
and framed another consort.

226
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,880
Your methods were vile.

227
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,040
By my decree.

228
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,920
Noble Consort Hui has a wicked heart

229
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,040
and has sown chaos in the harem.

230
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,120
Effective immediately,

231
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,120
strip her authority over the harem!

232
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:44,320
Maid Lyu'e stirred up discord

233
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,200
and framed a consort.

234
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,240
Take her away and beat her to death.

235
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:48,760
Your Majesty!

236
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,320
Move.

237
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,160
Spare me, Your Majesty!

238
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,360
Spare me!

239
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,520
Your Highness!

240
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,080
I'll never do it again!

241
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,320
I swear I won't!

242
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,120
Consort Qi.

243
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,960
You are gentle and virtuous,

244
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,120
wise and gracious.

245
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:03,600
From today, I grant you
the golden scroll and seal

246
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:04,680
to oversee the harem.

247
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

248
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,600
I shall serve with all my heart

249
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,600
and not let you down.

250
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:12,600
Rise.

251
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:13,920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

252
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:18,560
Cairen Rong.

253
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,400
You've been falsely accused.

254
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,720
Your Majesty sees all.

255
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:25,240
I'm more than grateful.

256
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,120
It's just that...

257
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,560
The prayer was interrupted.

258
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,920
May I continue praying here?

259
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,640
You've done so much for Mother and me.

260
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,800
How could I fail you?

261
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,080
You may continue your prayers.

262
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:41,960
By my decree.

263
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,000
Cairen Rong has prayed

264
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:46,000
devotedly for
the Empress Dowager and me.

265
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,320
Her loyalty is beyond question.

266
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:48,560
Effective immediately,

267
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,840
she is promoted to Zhaoyi.

268
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:52,160
She shall reside at Jinghe Palace.

269
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,320
I...

270
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

271
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,600
Thank you, Your Highness.

272
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,680
(Noble Consort Hui.)

273
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,280
(Making you lose
the Empress Dowager's trust)

274
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,600
(and your power over the harem)

275
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,800
(was only the first step.)

276
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,240
(As for your affair in the harem,)

277
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,400
(I'll leave that aside for now.)

278
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,840
(I want you to live in fear
every single day,)

279
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,200
(unable to dine or sleep in peace,)

280
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,160
(always wondering)

281
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,880
(when I'll expose)

282
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,120
(your filthy little secret.)

283
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,000
Lingxi...

284
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,920
Please forgive me

285
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,240
for failing to protect you.

286
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,640
Today

287
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,480
is the day your soul returns.

288
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,280
I'll mourn you myself.

289
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,200
May you be reborn soon.

290
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,720
In your next life,

291
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,320
may we be mother and daughter again.

292
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,240
We've been cleaning all day.

293
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,240
I'm exhausted.

294
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:56,080
Me too. Let's rest early.

295
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,080
All right.

296
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,960
You know what?

297
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,800
The second prince has fuzz in his ears.

298
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,520
It's all fuzzy.

299
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:03,400
So funny.

300
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,480
Fuzz in his ears?

301
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,960
How strange.

302
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,600
I know.

303
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,960
But the eldest prince has none.

304
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,720
I heard the old palace matrons say,

305
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,840
it's called hero's hair.

306
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:12,840
It's quite rare.

307
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,480
He'll be something when he grows up.

308
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,000
Oh, really?

309
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,360
That's fascinating.

310
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,840
(My grandmother once told me,)

311
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,400
(it's a condition called downy ear,)

312
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,000
(not some hero's hair.)

313
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:30,400
(It's hereditary.
A son only has it if his father does.)

314
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:35,160
(Today, Noble Consort Hui would rather
lose the Empress Dowager's support)

315
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,600
(than let anyone
investigate the cold palace.)

316
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:41,200
(Could there be something
even worse than an affair?)

317
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,800
(Could it be)

318
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:47,680
(the second prince isn't
His Majesty's blood?)

319
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:54,800
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

320
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:59,840
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

321
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:04,640
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

322
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:09,480
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

323
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:14,240
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

324
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:19,280
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

325
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:24,080
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

326
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:29,040
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

327
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:33,800
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

328
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:37,240
♪Let the stars and sea♪

329
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,740
(Changsheng Gate)

330
00:14:38,740 --> 00:14:42,560
♪Wait for your return♪
